      "majorma;Official name of the Major Managed Area.  Major Managed Area refers to a larger Managed Area that contains the Managed Area in question.;FNAI;varchar;;;;",
      "matype;Code for the Managed Area by lead managing agency. Each Managed Area has been coded as 1st byte = Managing Agency Category: F=Federal, S=State, L=Local, P=Private, 2nd and 3rd bytes = Managing Agency: (e.g., AF= US Air Force), 4th and 5th bytes = Managed Area Unit Type (e.g., AB= Air Force Base);The Nature Conservancy and FNAI;varchar;;;;",
