    "dct:description": "SIMULATED composite socioeconomic status index (0-100, higher = more affluent) for US counties, generated by the tutorial's synthetic data generator. It is correlated with county PM2.5 (about -0.3) so that SES confounds the PM2.5 effect. It is not a real county statistic. The index is static over 2014-2019 and is attached to the county polygons of the Census TIGER/Line 2023 counties.",
